---
import InnerLayout from '../layouts/InnerLayout.astro';
---

<InnerLayout
  title="Projects | EVO"
  description="Selected EVO engineering, automation and machine development projects."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container page-hero-inner">
      <div class="page-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">SELECTED WORK</p>
        <h1>Engineering that moves from <span>idea to impact.</span></h1>
        <p>A selection of automation, machine development, upgrades and technical problem-solving work that shows how EVO approaches real production challenges.</p>
        <div class="page-hero-actions"><a class="page-button page-button-primary" href="/contact">Start a Project ↗</a><a class="page-button page-button-secondary" href="/solutions">Explore Solutions</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="page-hero-visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="page-orb"></div><img src="/solutions/solution-custom-engineering.png" alt="" /></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="container page-section-inner">
      <div class="page-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PROJECT INDEX</p><h2>Built around <span>real constraints.</span></h2></div><p>These examples cover production automation, filling, weighing and machine improvement work. Detailed project pages can be added as the portfolio grows.</p></div>
      <div class="project-listing">
        <article><div class="project-meta"><span>01 · INDUSTRIAL AUTOMATION</span><span>STACKING</span></div><h3>Roofing Sheet Stacking System</h3><p>Automated handling concept developed for a demanding roofing-sheet production workflow.</p><small>Bluescope Lysaght Lanka</small></article>
        <article><div class="project-meta"><span>02 · PROCESS AUTOMATION</span><span>FILLING</span></div><h3>Engine Oil Filling System</h3><p>Integrated filling and control solution focused on repeatability, practical operation and clean production handling.</p><small>Caltex Lanka</small></article>
        <article><div class="project-meta"><span>03 · MACHINE CONTROL</span><span>WEIGHING</span></div><h3>50 kg Auto Weighing System</h3><p>Purpose-built automation for controlled material weighing and production handling.</p><small>Custom Engineering</small></article>
        <article><div class="project-meta"><span>04 · RETROFIT &amp; MODIFICATION</span><span>UPGRADE</span></div><h3>Machine Upgrades &amp; Line Improvements</h3><p>Control, mechanical and process improvements for existing industrial equipment and production lines.</p><small>Production Environments</small></article>
        <article><div class="project-meta"><span>05 · PACKAGING</span><span>MODIFICATION</span></div><h3>Packaging Machine Modification</h3><p>Engineering modifications intended to improve equipment fit, operation and production requirements.</p><small>Industrial Application</small></article>
        <article><div class="project-meta"><span>06 · PROCESS LINE</span><span>AUTOMATION</span></div><h3>Production Line Automation</h3><p>Integrated control and machine coordination for process-line operation and improved workflow.</p><small>Engineering Integration</small></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band"><div class="container cta-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT PROJECT</p><h2>Have a production problem that needs <span>engineering?</span></h2><p>Bring the problem, the constraints and the target. EVO can help shape the technical path.</p></div><a class="page-button page-button-primary" href="/contact">Talk to EVO ↗</a></div></section>
</InnerLayout>
